# Line endings
#
# Every source file in this project uses LF, including on Windows. Git for
# Windows ships with core.autocrlf=true at system level, which would rewrite the
# whole tree to CRLF on checkout — `git add` warned on all ~3,600 files here.
# This pins the behaviour to the repo so it holds for anyone who clones it,
# rather than depending on each machine's global config.
#
# `-text` = never convert, store and check out exactly the bytes committed.
* -text

# Binary assets: no diffing, no conversion, ever.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.mov  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.eot  binary
*.pdf  binary
